<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-10 max-w-xl">
                    Discover the timeless elegance of Athangudi tiles—a heritage craft from the heart of Chettinad, reimagined with modern architectural precision.
                </p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
