<!-- The Heritage Canvas -->
<section class="py-32 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-desktop">
<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start">
<div class="lg:col-span-5 mb-16 lg:mb-0">
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-8">Crafting the Soul of <span class="italic font-normal">Chettinad</span></h2>
<div class="space-y-6 font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
<p>
                            YirehMex Athangudi tiles are traditional handmade decorative tiles originating from the Chettinad region of Tamil Nadu, India. These tiles are renowned for their vibrant colors, intricate patterns, and durability.
                        </p>
<p>
                            Crafted using a unique blend of local materials—fine river sand, cement, and synthetic oxides—each tile is a testament to the artisan's touch. Also known as Chettinad tiles or Eco-friendly Heritage tiles, they breathe life into floors with a luster that only grows with time.
                        </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7">
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div class="bg-surface-cream p-8 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 group hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">eco</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4 text-on-surface">Eco-Friendly</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Naturally cured without high-intensity kilns, reducing carbon footprint significantly.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-cream p-8 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 mt-8 group hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">palette</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4 text-on-surface">Vibrant</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Intricate patterns and deep pigments that stay luminous for generations.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-cream p-8 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 group hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">hand_gesture</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4 text-on-surface">Handmade</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Each tile is individually poured and smoothed by master craftsmen.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-cream p-8 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 mt-8 group hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-4xl mb-6" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">verified</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4 text-on-surface">Durable</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Built to withstand the passage of time, perfect for modern luxury interiors.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- The Alchemist's Process (Bento) -->
<section class="py-32 bg-surface-cream tile-pattern-bg">
<div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-desktop">
<div class="text-center mb-20">
<h2 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-on-surface mb-4">The Making of a Legacy</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mx-auto">From the riverbed of Athangudi to the center stage of global architecture, our process remains pure.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 md:grid-rows-2 gap-6 h-full md:h-[800px]">
<!-- Step 1: Design -->
<div class="md:col-span-2 md:row-span-1 glass-panel p-10 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-end relative overflow-hidden group">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8">
<span class="font-headline-lg text-primary opacity-20">01</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4 text-on-surface">Intricate Brass Stenciling</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Master artisans place custom-designed brass frames on a glass plate, ensuring the mathematical precision of every pattern.</p>
</div>
<!-- Step 2: Mixing -->
<div class="md:col-span-1 md:row-span-1 bg-architectural-blue p-10 rounded-xl text-white flex flex-col justify-end group">
<span class="font-headline-lg text-white opacity-20 block mb-auto">02</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4">Tonal Pigmentation</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md opacity-80">Local river sand is mixed with premium oxides to create the signature earthy palette of YirehMex.</p>
</div>
<!-- Step 3: Puring -->
<div class="md:col-span-1 md:row-span-2 relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent z-10"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-10 z-20">
<span class="font-headline-lg text-white opacity-40">03</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-white mt-4 mb-2">Artisan Pouring</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-white/80">Every color layer is hand-poured into the stencil with absolute focus.</p>
</div>
<div class="w-full h-full bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" data-alt="A macro close-up of a skilled artisan hand-pouring vibrant terracotta and cream-colored liquid cement into an intricate brass tile stencil. The lighting is soft and focused, highlighting the texture of the materials. The overall aesthetic is one of master craftsmanship and artisanal heritage in a clean workshop setting." style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAwAhAxvZlKru0Dt2HRfhLcNOHI_Bsx2Ncchw59lPd7GEo8WlIVUiQoDoaZoXsEsWIbXoM57uBK8a-9thIUGd_YizlplTqbOXyjvJaBOjPFv6ihyn0d-6fPuHs4kLfsoANpq-O607qU2XNHmvVQYMHnNx9in-Y2MSkzIg8J_WHDX7ChdlgLUAxGAqbPRfeqgDhb2QGEEu_H6O8I4oVjqV_ZFNNXqHctGxtortJsNQuF76COfetLU7f2t-6VAxlrKpRd61xhjt6S05k')"></div>
</div>
<!-- Step 4: Curing -->
<div class="md:col-span-2 md:row-span-1 bg-heritage-crimson p-10 rounded-xl text-white flex items-center gap-10 group overflow-hidden">
<div class="flex-1">
<span class="font-headline-lg text-white opacity-20 block mb-6">04</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4">Natural Drying &amp; Curing</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md opacity-80">Tiles are sun-dried and water-cured for days, allowing the strength to build naturally without kiln-firing.</p>
</div>
<div class="hidden lg:block w-48 h-48 bg-white/10 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 animate-pulse"></div>
</div>
<!-- Step 5: Polishing -->
<div class="md:col-span-1 md:row-span-1 bg-white p-10 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col justify-end group">
<span class="font-headline-lg text-on-surface-variant opacity-20 block mb-auto">05</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4 text-on-surface">The Final Polish</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">The tiles are buffed with coconut husks, a traditional technique that creates a lifelong, gentle sheen.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
