<h4 class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 text-primary-fixed-dim">Join the Legacy</h4>
<p class="font-body-md text-surface-variant/80 mb-6">Receive curated design inspiration and heritage stories.</p>
<form class="flex gap-2">
<input class="bg-white/5 border border-white/20 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 flex-1 text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" placeholder="Email Address" type="email"/>
