</div>
<div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-desktop border-t border-white/10 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
<p class="font-label-sm text-label-sm opacity-40">
                © 2024 YIREHMEX Athangudi Tiles. Handcrafted Heritage, Modern Precision.
